      "title": "ChatGPT helped me find a problem I didn’t know I had",
      "url": "https://www.reddit.com/r/shopify/comments/1wdiply/chatgpt_helped_me_find_a_problem_i_didnt_know_i/",
      "source": "r/shopify",
      "published": "2026-09-11T15:00:39+00:00",
      "summary": "I run a small store and don’t really know much about how ChatGPT works. A customer came in recently asking about a product we stopped selling months ago. I asked where they saw it and they said ChatGPT recommended it. So I checked ChatGPT myself and yep, it was still recommending the old product. I told it the product was discontinued and asked why it was still recommending it. I figured that would do it. Nope. Still there. That made me wonder if this was just a ChatGPT problem, so I used Pallas",
